  "_design": [
    "One verb per class (DESIGN.md principle 4). A class you cannot describe in one",
    "sentence is a class that will not read at the table:",
    "  Barbarian  damage is fuel      Bard      buff the whole board",
    "  Cleric     heal and preserve   Druid     small things that grow",
    "  Fighter    honest efficient    Monk      many cheap actions",
    "  Paladin    protect, then hit   Ranger    precision plus a companion",
    "  Rogue      conditional burst   Sorcerer  volatile power",
    "  Warlock    pay health for it   Wizard    spells pay off spells",
    "  Tinkerer   build your own      Neutral   the shared floor",
    "",
    "Rarity tiers follow Adam's own Milanote tiering, not a new invention:",
    "  common fighter/ranger · uncommon barbarian/rogue/cleric/bard",
    "  rare paladin/tinkerer/monk/wizard · epic druid/sorcerer/warlock",
    "Since the engine has three rarities, that maps to: common, rare, legendary,",
    "with a class's signature card carrying the highest rarity it is entitled to.",
    "",
    "Effects: damage · damageEnemyCaster · damageAllEnemyCreatures · damageOwnCaster",
    "         damageRandomEnemyCreature · destroyTarget · healCaster · healTarget",
    "         draw · buffTarget · buffSelf · buffAllFriendly · grantTaunt · summon",
    "Conditions: firstSpellThisTurn",
    "Elements: fire | water | storm   Targeting: none | optionalCreature | requiredCreature",
    "Aura scopes: friendlyOthers | friendlyAll | enemyAll | allCreatures"
  ],

